<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Security contact</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Report a concern privately.</h1><p class="lede fade">Help us understand a suspected issue without putting people or systems at risk.</p><p class="doc-meta">Last updated November 2, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#section-0">Contact</a><a href="#section-1">Useful information</a><a href="#section-2">Responsible scope</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">More</p><nav aria-label="Legal"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/legal{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-legal{% endif %}">All legal information</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="section-0"><i>01</i><h2>Contact</h2><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> with a first report, and ask us for a secure channel before sending sensitive evidence.</p></section><section id="section-1"><i>02</i><h2>Useful information</h2><p>Describe the affected address, what happened and the minimum steps needed to explain the issue. Remove credentials, personal records and unnecessary data from any material you share.</p></section><section id="section-2"><i>03</i><h2>Responsible scope</h2><p>Do not access another person’s information, disrupt a service or perform destructive testing. This page does not establish a bounty, a legal safe-harbor promise or a disclosure deadline. We aim to reply to reports by email within two business days.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></section>
